# Gkmex inventory

Use `https://gkmex.com/openapi.json` for the REST contract or `https://gkmex.com/mcp` for MCP. The integration is public, zero-auth and read-only. Cite listing URLs, interpret null prices as POA and require final confirmation from Gkmex.
